<title>CHINA: Shanghai Electric exports power equipment to Iran.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Electric exports power equipment to Iran.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Electric Corp has signed a contract with Iran to export two sets of coal-fired 325,000 KW power-generating equipment to Iran, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The official said it was the first time the company had exported this type of power-generating equipment to Iran, but he declined to give any details of the contract.</p>
<p>Shanghai Electric Corp is a conglomerate owned by the Shanghai municipal government.</p>
